<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cue PNG prospecting licences renewed.</title>
<headline>Cue PNG prospecting licences renewed.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand-listed Cue Energy Resources No Liability said on Thursday that the Papua New Guinea government had this month granted Cue and its coventurers two new petroleum prospecting licences over substantially the area of PPL 56 which expired on December 12, 1996.</p>
